flowchart TB
    subgraph K8S[Kubernetes / workload observability]
      KSM[kube-state-metrics]
      NODE[node-exporter\nsystem-cluster-critical]
      WORK[AEGIS Pods / workloads]
      PROM[Prometheus]
      GRAF[Grafana]
      DASH[AEGIS Platform Health]

      KSM --> PROM
      NODE --> PROM
      WORK --> PROM
      PROM --> GRAF
      GRAF --> DASH
    end

    subgraph AWS[AWS edge / security observability]
      WAF[AWS WAF metrics + BLOCK logs]
      ALB[ALB metrics]
      PIPE[Security-event pipeline alarms]
      AI[AEGIS/AIQuality]
      CW[CloudWatch dashboards / alarms]

      WAF --> CW
      ALB --> CW
      PIPE --> CW
      AI --> CW
    end

    ARGO[Argo CD application health] --> OPS[Operator / analyst]
    DASH --> OPS
    CW --> OPS

    NOTE[Prometheus/Grafana and CloudWatch are complementary.\nArgo health is a separate GitOps control-plane signal.]
    NOTE -. model .-> OPS
